      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.070 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "c7aacb21-fa67-59c4-9095-242a3b4e4f5f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 241,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:1",
          "start": 15
        },
        "quote": "(1) All signs and structures supporting signs shall be placed in or upon private property except as expressly permitted and shall be securely built, constructed and erected in conformance with the requirements of this chapter.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.070 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "b140f973-670c-5aed-9e13-66edbbeccbe3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 378,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:2",
          "start": 242
        },
        "quote": "(2) No portion of a sign surface or sign structure shall be located on or over a public right-of-way except as provided in this chapter.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.070 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "f57d8f46-0196-5edf-b35e-5b74ada9a76a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 517,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:3",
          "start": 379
        },
        "quote": "(3) No sign shall be erected which is connected to or obstructs any portion of a fire escape or windows or doors leading to a fire escape.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.070 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "90b7a545-d16e-5d50-9eb9-79e24907e1ce",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 664,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:4",
          "start": 518
        },
        "quote": "(4) No sign shall obstruct any opening to such an extent that light or ventilation is reduced to a point below that required by the building code.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.070 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "3218d985-59a4-5c20-84f7-29c7fccc2871",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 908,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:5",
          "start": 665
        },
        "quote": "(b) Illumination. Illumination for types of signs is regulated in TMC 18.10.130 , 18.10.160 , and 18.10.180 . In no case shall the light from an illuminated sign create a negative effect on residential uses in direct line-of-sight of the sign.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.070 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "ac861a7f-9276-56e6-91cd-8073608730eb",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1049,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:6",
          "start": 909
        },
        "quote": "(c) Sight Distance at Intersections. No sign that obstructs the view is allowed within the sight distance triangle of a street intersection.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.070 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "0300709a-c8c4-578f-a227-4c3ec985646a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1083,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:7",
          "start": 1050
        },
        "quote": "(d) Other Applicable Regulations.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.070 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "b85b25eb-d23b-56de-84e2-1cd51b60d9ed",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1224,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:8",
          "start": 1084
        },
        "quote": "(1) All signs shall be installed, erected, constructed, hung, or altered in accordance with the building and fire codes adopted by the City.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.070 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "40ad1324-72af-5b41-9ccd-fd658ea4b442",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1408,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:9",
          "start": 1225
        },
        "quote": "(2) Any structure that is built or constructed and supports or is capable of supporting a sign shall be constructed in compliance with the building and fire codes adopted by the City.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.070 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "8724fd08-4488-5d51-9913-b4fa70a1cb01",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1653,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:10",
          "start": 1409
        },
        "quote": "(3) A sign structure shall include the foundation and base, the poles or pylons that support the sign, any structural extensions that support a sign or sign cabinet, and any structural framework that supports a sign, sign face, or sign cabinet.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.070 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "a345303d-8680-52fc-ac4f-b55f61788ae0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1893,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:11",
          "start": 1654
        },
        "quote": "(4) Design documents for the structure that have been prepared, sealed, signed and dated by a structural engineer and designed in accordance with the building code must be submitted for review and approval with the sign permit application.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.070 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "7e188de5-3f76-5500-832a-ca01fa40c872",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2108,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:12",
          "start": 1894
        },
        "quote": "(5) All signs projecting over the public right-of-way (PROW) vertical clearance must be maintained as required by the currently adopted codes and ordinances for use of the PROW in accordance with the building code.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.070 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "1aac9465-f5d3-52b0-a50b-ed5f1d1fbb67",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2431,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:13",
          "start": 2109
        },
        "quote": "(6) All signs projecting over walkways, sidewalks, or other areas in front of a building, or other active area where pedestrians have access, shall maintain a minimum of eight feet of vertical clearance and as required by the currently adopted codes and ordinances for use of the PROW in accordance with the building code.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.070 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "eabfac87-ea44-5c07-826a-7b337865061a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2525,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:14",
          "start": 2432
        },
        "quote": "(7) Projecting wall signs shall project only as allowed in compliance with the building code.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.070 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "1ab17bad-cb98-5baa-afa6-5fcc8a684cf4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2742,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:15",
          "start": 2526
        },
        "quote": "(8) Awnings, canopies, awning signs, and canopy signs shall be securely attached to and supported by the building to which they are attached and shall properly be maintained in such manner. (Ord. 20207 § 8, 9-10-19.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.070:block:15#text",
